<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::allied_political_cohesio" target="ai_infra_market_shift::regulatory_scrutiny" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater policy alignment among allied governments enables coordinated export controls, screening regimes and joint oversight initiatives that increase the intensity and scope of AI regulatory scrutiny across their jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::allied_political_cohesio" target="cyber_critical_attacks::detection_response_cap" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved allied political cohesion produces faster intelligence sharing, coordinated incident-triage and access to partner SOC resources, directly increasing collective detection and response capability across allied networks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">cyber_critical_attacks</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::allied_political_cohesio" target="iran_gulf_escalation::diplomatic_activity_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A decline in cohesion among states supporting Ukraine reduces shared diplomatic bandwidth, unity of messaging and willingness to lead crisis management, causing a drop in coordinated diplomatic engagement in the Gulf theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::allied_political_cohesio" target="sino_us_geoecon_rivalry::export_control_stringenc" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater policy alignment among the US and its European/Asian partners in support of Ukraine enables coordinated development and implementation of harmonized export‑control lists and enforcement mechanisms, increasing overall stringency on sensitive tech exports affecting US–China trade.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
</edge>
