  <data key="d37">An uptick in on‑the‑ground kinetic attacks and military clashes raises perceived transit and partner‑risk for firms, causing accelerated corporate decisions to reconfigure sourcing and production footprints away from exposed Middle‑East routes and suppliers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
  <data key="d40">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
</edge>
