  <data key="d37">High geographic concentration of critical inputs (e.g., fabs, specialized components) raises vulnerability to sanctions, port closures or production interruptions, causing procurements to be postponed and infrastructure projects to be delayed.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
</edge>
