  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher geographic concentration of critical production and inputs creates few high‑value targets (fabs, logistics hubs, component suppliers) that attackers focus on, raising the frequency of successful disruptive or espionage cyber operations.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">cyber_critical_attacks</data>
