<edge source="ai_infra_market_shift::compute_capacity_stock" target="cyber_critical_attacks::cyber_attack_incidence" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid increase in installed AI compute (GPUs/TPUs) expands attacker access to high-throughput training/inference resources (via compromised cloud accounts, stolen credits, or affordable rentals), enabling automated exploit discovery, large‑scale phishing personalization, and faster brute‑force/ML-powered attacks that raise the rate of successful intrusions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">cyber_critical_attacks</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_infra_market_shift::compute_capacity_stock" target="russia_ukraine_war::kinetic_conflict_intensi" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid increases in installed AI compute enable faster processing of ISR imagery and real‑time targeting algorithms, enabling more frequent and more precise strike and autonomous operations and thus raising the frequency/scale of kinetic actions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ai_infra_market_shift::compute_capacity_stock" target="sino_us_geoecon_rivalry::domestic_tech_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid increase in operational AI compute in-country directly enables local firms and labs to train large models, prototype hardware-software integrations, and retain talent, accelerating domestic ability to design and produce advanced AI systems and components.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
</edge>
