  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Intensified regulatory oversight of AI technologies creates political and evidentiary pressure on regulators to broaden and tighten export/import controls on related hardware, software and components to limit cross‑border transfers.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_infra_market_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">sino_us_geoecon_rivalry</data>
