  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">An uptick in successful cyber intrusions against shipping companies, port operators, or vessel navigation/control systems directly causes navigation failures, AIS spoofing, or port-operational outages that produce collisions, groundings, or confrontations at sea.</data>
