  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater cross‑boundary interconnectivity that exposes data and workloads to external jurisdictions drives firms to invest in additional regional or private data centers to localize data and reduce exposure, increasing build activity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
