  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater technical and organizational interconnectivity allows malware or operational failures to propagate from corporate IT into industrial control systems for pipelines, terminals, and refineries, producing direct physical interruptions of oil and gas flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">cyber_critical_attacks</data>
