  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Greater density and permeability of technical, financial, and organizational links across Russian, Ukrainian and third‑party domains raises the chance that cyber operations will spill over to or implicate outside states, prompting great‑power responses and intensifying external security competition pressures on the conflict.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
